{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1172088-white-yeddim-the-sixth-dragon-apologies-for-letipex","id":1172088,"title":"White Yeddim: The Sixth Dragon (Apologies for LeTipex)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-31T15:41:29-08:00","id":1172088,"title":"White Yeddim: The Sixth Dragon (Apologies for LeTipex)","content":"I want to apologize to LeTipex for being late in his white Yeddim gift, i suffered an accident and broke my arms, so i was unable to write and type while in hospital.<br /> <br /> But dont worry, i didnt forget to work on your gift, is still unfinished, but i think i can finish it this week, for now, i post what i had before my bad moment.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>The Sixth Dragon</b><br /> <br /> Back in time, when the gods decided to overthrow their creators from heaven and the weapons started to take form, the elemental dragons that took part on the process where not 5. A sixth dragon existed that also lend his essence to forge an exaltation from his type. This was a serpentine display of golden crystal that resembled the brightness of orichalcum when exposed to sunlight.<br /> <br /> When the first dragon blooded exaltations where being forged, this dragon had an idea: why to limit the creation of hosts, why not grant every human an exaltation, a weapon to fight the primordials, that way the victory would be assured from start, the primordials shouldn't be able to stand against the sheer numbers of the whole humanity race with exaltations. So this dragon modified the way his type of exaltation would multiply: First, this exaltation would have a 100% chance of breeding another dragon blooded, every time with no limit, and the second and most terrifying of all, every time a host mate with someone, that someone would be able to ignite an exaltation within one year.<br /> <br /> The reasons of the sixth dragon where not from greed or madness, he was the Elemental Dragon of Union and Reject, the dragon in charge to make things a whole instead of separated parts, as well as the one in charge of drawing the limit line to everything. What this dragon wanted was to even every human, se they could still be a whole instead of found themselves divided between the powerfull and the powerless.<br /> <br /> But Gaea look this as a posible way to overthrow what they where planning, then, when the first dragon blooded of each element were born, raised, and started multiplying, when Gaea and the other dragons realized the absurd multiply rate of the yellow exaltation they acted: they started to eliminate every single Union dragon blooded.<br /> <br /> Watching their childs being slaughtered, the Sixth dragon took the very fist of them, the one carrying the original spark, and fled with him, during this process, 2 things happened, being the Dragon of Reject, he drew a borderline between him and his mother, so he was no longer an elemental dragon, but before fleeing succesfully, Gaea, and the Elemental dragon of Wood bestowed a curse over the fist yellow dragon blooded: first, Gaea locked the spark of his exaltation, so mating with others would not ignite another spark, and second, the Elemental Dragon of Wood, that is also the dragon of life and death, made him sterile, to prevent him from having more childs. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/278-elyon","name":"Elyon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar278_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"149"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-01T14:04:22-08:00","id":1172379,"title":"","content":"Dude, don't worry about being late: first off you're not (the cutoff date is the 10th of January), and second, taking care of your health is WAY more important than any type of forum gift. Thank you for posting it nonetheless, I'm curious as to the end of that particular story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-02T13:10:35-08:00","id":1172716,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that is one heck of an excuse. Glad you're oka- *ahem* not worse.<br /> <br /> Interesting concept you've got here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4596-ren9077","name":"Ren9077","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"593"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}